          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>People with chronic skin conditions are up to 6x more likely to face depression or anxiety, and 1 in 4 young adults, women, and people of color experience a mental health disorder each year.</p><p>At Topicals, we know skin struggles aren’t just physical; they’re emotional, too. That’s why we remind you: perfect skin isn’t real. You decide what looks good.</p>"
